cube-browser uses the memory parser only, after strict Expat validation and
reconstruction of a bounded SVG subset. Cairo renders the resulting paths.
NanoSVG's file loader, CSS stylesheet parser and original untrusted XML parser
are not exposed to web content. No NanoSVG rasterizer is used.
